      "page": "b",
      "text": "B, light and dark\n\n1. The sun and moon button in the header switches the theme on every board. The background crossfades from night to day.\n2. B1 keeps the Earth photo. Its day version is a Gemini edit of the same view.\n3. B2 is the map recipe of the TMASI maritime map, in HCIG colours: pale land and turquoise sea by day, glowing coasts and city lights by night. Egypt is shaded.\n4. Routes start in the seven site language markets: London, Paris, Madrid, Berlin, Warsaw, Prague, Milan. Say if you want other cities.\n5. Become a Partner added beside Talk to our team (your yes).\n6. Tweaks: Theme (starting theme), Shade, Motion."
